        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>♏ The Scorpio Cloth.</strong> <em>[OFFENSE]</em></p><h3>Cloth Passive — Fifteen Needles</h3><p>Track <strong>needles</strong> on each creature separately; they reset when the creature takes a full rest or when the encounter ends.</p><p>Whenever you hit a creature with an unarmed Strike, you may spend a <strong>free action</strong> to add one needle, to a maximum of 15.</p><p>At <strong>5 needles</strong> the creature is enfeebled 1. At <strong>10</strong> it is blinded. At <strong>14</strong> it is stunned 2 and its Strikes lose all runes.</p><hr /><p><strong>Tracking note:</strong> the resource on your sheet counts needles on your <em>current</em> target and the toggles flag which threshold is live. Needles on several creatures at once have to be tracked by hand — the system has no per-target counter.</p><h3>Techniques</h3><ul><li><strong>1st &mdash; Signature (L1)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Scarlet Needle]</li><li><strong>2nd (L6)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Crimson Mirage]</li><li><strong>3rd &mdash; Cloth Ability (L11)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Crimson Flurry]</li><li><strong>4th &mdash; Ultimate (L16)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Antares]</li></ul><h3>Ascendant Boon — Antares <em>[OFFENSE]</em></h3><p>Needles land on <strong>any attack, hit or miss</strong>. Each needle deals @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]] damage, stacking, <strong>capped at 10 needles</strong> of bleed.</p><p>At <strong>8 needles</strong> the target must attempt a Fortitude save against your Cosmo DC or <strong>die</strong>. <strong>Incapacitation.</strong></p><p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-effects.Item.Sky: Ascendant (Scorpio)]</p><h3>Zenith Boon — Antares (Zenith) <em>[OFFENSE]</em></h3><p>As the Ascendant Boon; Antares triggers at <strong>5 needles</strong>, and your allies' hits apply needles too.</p><p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-effects.Item.Sky: Zenith (Scorpio)]</p>"
        },
